2026-10-02T16:59:49.1223146Z   ok   with the optimizer off a legionella action still current never turns the disinfection switch on (null control above: on, it does)
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1224491Z   ok   the boost bound closes the window and turns the switch OFF once
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1225256Z   ok   a boost the bound closed is not switched back on by the same command
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1226148Z   ok   …and once the plan has moved on, the next commanded boost turns it on
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1226904Z   ok   disabling disinfection during a boost turns the switch OFF
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1227644Z   ok   no ON while this cycle's mode reading blocks hot water, logged once
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1229044Z   ok   …and the ON goes out on the first cycle the mode allows hot water, with no solve between
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1229991Z   ok   a switch that was already on is left alone through a whole boost and after it
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1230752Z   ok   an idle control install writes nothing, not even OFF
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1231427Z   ok   a failed write raises a non-persistent repair naming the switch
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1232267Z   ok   …the next cycle retries the ON, and its success clears the repair
2026-10-02T16:59:49.1233009Z   ok   a failed OFF at the close is retried on the next idle cycle, once
